      "title": "Create a Separate List for 2027 New Grad Roles",
      "description": "### Improvement\n\n2027 new graduate roles have started opening, but they are currently mixed with roles intended for earlier graduating classes.\n\nIt would be helpful to create a separate section, page, or table specifically for **2027 New Grad positions**.\n\n### Suggested changes\n\n- Add a dedicated list for roles targeting students graduating in 2027.\n- Clearly display the eligible graduation year or graduation window for each position.\n- Keep 2026 and 2027 roles separated so applicants can quickly find relevant opportunities.\n- Optionally add a graduation-year filter if maintaining separate lists becomes difficult.\n\nThis would make the repository easier to navigate and prevent students from applying to roles for which they are not eligible.",
